 a nmea gps.\n2. updates the home position on the map. (note does not update home on the MAV)\n\nHow to use it\n1. connect to ap.\n2. open this and pick your comport, and baud rate for your nmea gps.\n3. it should now be updating home.":"What this does.\n1. gets the current gps coords from a nmea gps.\n2. sends a guided mode WP to the AP every 2 seconds.\n\nHow to use it\n1. connect to ap.\n2. take off, test guided mode is working.\n3. open this and pick your comport, and baud rate for your nmea gps.\n4. it should now be following you.","Wizard":"Assistant","Write":"Écrire PNs","Write Fast":"Écriture rapide","Write Flash":"Écrire la flash","Write Params":"Écrire les paramètres","Yaw 2 roll":"P","Yaw Orientation":"Mode de vol 2","Yaw Rate Limit":"Limite taux de lacet","You cannot load new firmware while connected via MAVLink. \n\nPlease press the Disconnect button at top right to end the current MAVLink session and enable the firmware loading screen.":"Vous ne pouvez pas charger un nouveau firmware tant que vous êtes connecté via MAVLink. \n\nVeuillez appuyer sur le bouton Déconnecter en haut à droite pour terminer la session MAVLink en cours et activer l'écran de chargement du firmware.","You only need to use this if you are having issue with your OSD not updating":"Utilisez ceci uniquement si votre OSD ne se met pas à jour","Zero":"Mode de vol 1","Zero Attitude":"Réinitialiser l'attitude","Zero Pressure":"Réinitialiser la pression","Zoom To":"Zoomer vers","Zoom to Home":"Zoomer sur le point d'origine","Zoom to Mission":"Zoomer sur la mission","Zoom to Vehicle":"Zoomer sur le véhicule","degrees, relative to vehicle":"degrés, relatif au véhicule","in Hg":"Bank Max","maximum speed of motors while in flight (almost all escs have a deadzone at the top)":"Vitesse maximum des moteurs en vol (la plupart des ESC ont une zone morte en haut)","metres down":"mètres vers le bas","metres foward":"mètres vers l'avant","metres from ground":"mètres du sol","metres right":"mètres vers la droite","minimum speed of motors while in flight (slightly higher than \"Spin when Armed\")":"Vitesse minimum des moteurs en vol (légèrement supérieure à « Rotation quand armé »)","speed when motors are armed but throttle is at zero (idle)":"Vitesse quand les moteurs sont armés mais les gaz à zéro (ralenti)"}}